            <div class="proj-desc">
                I help grow the Angular and Nx communities through talks, streams, open source, and
                mentoring. Check my contributions on GitHub.
            </div>
            <div class="proj-tags">
                <span class="tag">Angular</span>
                <span class="tag">Nx</span>
                <span class="tag">Community</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="proj-stat">
            <span class="proj-stat-label">Profile</span>
            <a href="https://developers.google.com/profile/u/jaycooperbell" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="proj-visit">Google →</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-item">
        <div>
            <div class="proj-number">04 — Work</div>
            <div class="proj-title">Trellis</div>
            <div class="proj-desc">
                Building software that has to hold up when it matters most — empowering global collective
